    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Woken up suddenly,  you play as Michael Salvatore, a father tormented by the sudden disappearance of his daughter, Haze..As you investigate Haze\u2019s room, you\u2019ll uncover tools \u2014 like the axe embedded in her bedroom wall \u2014 that may seem like\u00a0 the only way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >LATE 2 ESCAPE: CHAPTER 1 includes a a twisted compelling story that gets better through each chapter.While playing Chapter 1 you will collect items that belongs to your daughter Haze.  <br>\u00a0 \u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419560/extras/241ecfb8796d5d949f507d78bbbf9c2c.avif?t=1754860786\" width=500 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419560/extras/bfafcf002a5d2212ac45b41ccdddea51.poster.avif?t=1754860786\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419560/extras/bfafcf002a5d2212ac45b41ccdddea51.webm?t=1754860786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419560/extras/bfafcf002a5d2212ac45b41ccdddea51.mp4?t=1754860786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Matches are your main sources of light \u2014 and your only comfort. Use them to </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ignite candles that reveal hidden symbols, paths, or ward off the oppressive </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >darkness creeping in around you.&quot;Matches don\u2019t grow on body bags \u2014 use them </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >like your life depends on it&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419560/extras/f28ca565a22a305b40af84a451455b6e.avif?t=1754860786\" width=500 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419560/extras/e06391bcad8b045c8b3297b82e1e91f9.poster.avif?t=1754860786\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419560/extras/e06391bcad8b045c8b3297b82e1e91f9.webm?t=1754860786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419560/extras/e06391bcad8b045c8b3297b82e1e91f9.mp4?t=1754860786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Found buried in the room of your missing daughter Haze, this axe is more than a tool </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2014 it\u2019s a turning point. Use it to shatter obstacles, and a variety of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is it a weapon? A message? Or just the start of something worse?</p>",
